# Models + Kronos Rules

- Do not edit `vendor/Kronos` unless explicitly requested.
- Do not commit weights, caches, or downloaded assets.
- Preserve missing/invalid-artifact fallback and stable feature/artifact contracts.
- Prevent leakage and look-ahead bias.
- Record provenance, timeframe, dataset range, and evaluation method.
- Do not claim improved profitability without reproducible out-of-sample evidence.
- Keep dynamic weights bounded, persisted safely, and reversible.
